{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner just moved into a new house, and it turns out there is something really bad going on. All your nightmares become true in a chaotic night, you won't be able to rest much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.poster.avif?t=1767113561\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.webm?t=1767113561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.mp4?t=1767113561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a good couple? You'll need to work together and be in perfect harmony or you won't make it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.poster.avif?t=1767113561\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.webm?t=1767113561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.mp4?t=1767113561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleeping will be crucial to save energy and advance through the night, but you also need to find a key to escape from the house and discover what is beyond the garden gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.poster.avif?t=1767113561\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.webm?t=1767113561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.mp4?t=1767113561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for two players. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the network with your friends using Steam Remote Play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone too, but it won't be as fun and you may die quick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil Artificial Intelligence  rules over the house, making every night a different experience.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pillow Fight!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/4a2f50a0c23e6d6e0d20a2144431e415f75e76d1.jpg"},{"name":"Midnight Kiss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/06c8fac00eb331d7d8f417c00f9264dd265c2bd2.jpg"},{"name":"Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/c6c74b6c47323407fc76556fc1c6636a4b0a2897.jpg"},{"name":"Pumpkin Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/7cc9551d627d0dc9251d68e3bb0a558049d3730a.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images